{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今晚六合彩攪珠，自動攪珠機懷疑故障，要轉用後備攪珠機。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">晚上九時半舉行的六合彩攪珠，彩球在攪珠機滾動停止後，未有如常升起幸運號碼彩球，攪珠隨即暫停。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">監場嘉賓見證下　換後備機重新攪珠</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在兩名監場嘉賓見證下，改用現場另一部後備攪珠機，將新一套彩球放入機內，之後重新攪珠。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HKJC-2230.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026jBgJmkDRF61789227463.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKJC-2230.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HKJC-2230_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026sBNfiW0IcY1789227472.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKJC-2230_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次是馬會在5月轉用第五代攪珠機後，第一次故障。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1194892-%E5%85%AD%E5%90%88%E5%BD%A95%E6%9C%88%E8%BD%89%E7%94%A8%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E4%BB%A3%E6%94%AA%E7%8F%A0%E6%A9%9F%E5%BE%8C%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">六合彩：5月轉用第五代攪珠機後首次故障｜延伸閱讀</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HKJC-2230_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026UVGIVQ6sRK1789225478.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKJC-2230_003.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T16:59:23.250010+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}